  "image": "https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2024-4-16/20244161533284890.png",
  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><a href=\"https://www.guhecloud.com/programme/physical.html\" target=\"_self\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">智慧场馆</span></span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"></span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">是运用</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">AI、边缘计算等先进技术和智能化设备，为运动员和管理者提供便利、舒适和高效的服务。而数字孪生智慧场馆平台是一个很大的平台，里面包含的系统功能也很多，今天古河云科技就来给大家聊一聊智慧场馆有哪些系统功能？</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2024-4-16/20244161533284890.png\" title=\"65\" alt=\"65\" /><br /></span><strong style=\"font-family:宋体, 微软雅黑, arial;font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0px;font-size:14px;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;\">1. </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:0px;font-size:14px;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;font-family:宋体;\">消防系统功能</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><br /></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">利用传感器、监控设备和网络技术，实现对智慧场馆内火灾风险的实时监测、预警和报警，同时通过智能控制系统对消防设施进行联动控制，提高火灾处置的效率和安全性。对灭火设备进行智能化管理，提高火灾防范的有效性。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;margin-left:0;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">安防系统功能</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">通过视频监控、智能识别、入侵报警等技术手段，建立全面覆盖的安防监控系统，对智慧场馆内的安全隐患进行实时监测和预警，对异常事件快速响应和处置，从而保障场馆安全。利用人脸识别等先进技术，建立智能门禁系统，实现对园区内人员和车辆出入的自动化管理。确保只有授权人员可以进入特定区域，同时记录出入信息，提高园区的安全性和管理效率，以便溯源。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;margin-left:0;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">照明系统功能</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">采用智能照明系统，通过感应器、亮度调节、定时开关等功能，实现对智慧场馆内照明设备的智能控制和管理。根据光线强度和时间自动调整灯光亮度和开关状态。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;margin-left:0;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">能源管理系统</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">智慧场馆通过建设能源互联网和智能能源管理系统，实现了对能源的统一管理和控制，包括电力、燃气、水的监测和控制等方面，减少了资源浪费，也保障了用能的安全和可靠性。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">以上就是关于智慧场馆的一些功能介绍了，随着数字化的不断发展，也越来越重视数字孪生这一块的应用，这种融合基础设施不仅能体现出场馆的专业性和便利性，而且还能提高场馆的安全和节能环保等特性。</span></p>",
